flowchart LR
  subgraph inbound [Agents call us]
    a1[Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, ...] -->|MCP tools and resources| m[fyke mcp]
    a2[Anything with a shell] -->|fyke ... --json| c[fyke CLI]
  end
  m -->|operations| ops[Operation registry]
  c -->|operations| ops
  subgraph outbound [We call agents]
    ops -->|job| r[Job runner]
    r -->|HTTPS| h[Model API or Ollama]
    r -->|JSON on stdin and stdout| e[Script using any agent SDK]
    r -->|ACP over stdio| p[Any ACP agent]
  end
  p -->|given fyke mcp at session/new| m
